    "id": "0113-teacher-noticing",
    "batchId": "batch-002",
    "categoryCode": "01",
    "fieldCode": "0113",
    "fieldTitle": "Teacher training without subject specialisation",
    "fieldTitleZh": "非学科专项教师培养",
    "title": "Three Short Lines in the Margin",
    "titleZh": "页边的三道短线",
    "summary": "After marking every correct answer, a teacher notices that the same small drawing has been hiding in the margin.",
    "summaryZh": "一名教师批完所有正确答案后，才注意到同一幅小图一直躲在页边。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "Teacher Lin marked quickly. Correct answers received circles, mistakes received dots, and the most common error became the next day's review. Rui'an's workbook was almost all circles, but he kept drawing three short lines with four small spaces beneath them in the margin. Teacher Lin assumed he was distracted and moved on.",
      "During a measurement lesson, Rui'an described a strip four units long as five. Two days later, he said the distance from three to seven on a number line was five. One answer was right and one wrong, yet the same little drawing appeared beside both.",
      "At lunch, Teacher Lin did not ask him to repeat the whole page. She placed a ruler on the desk and asked him to show how many intervals lay between two marks. Rui'an counted the marks themselves: 'One, two, three, four, five.' He was counting endpoints rather than the distance between them.",
      "That afternoon, Teacher Lin drew chalk lines across the floor. The class stood on one line and counted the steps needed to reach another. She did not announce that this was Rui'an's mistake. After taking four steps, he turned, looked at the five lines on the floor, and opened his workbook to the earlier page.",
      "After school, Teacher Lin drew a small circle beside the sketch in the margin. The next day, she looked at the drawing before she looked at the answer."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "林老师批改得很快。对的画圈，错的打点，第二天先讲错得最多的一题。瑞安的练习册几乎全是圈，他却总在页边画三道短线，下面再添四个小格。林老师以为那只是走神，没有多看。",
      "测量课上，瑞安把一段四格长的木条写成五格。两天后的数轴题，他又把从三到七的距离算成五。答案一对一错，页边却都有那三道短线和四个小格。",
      "午休时，林老师没有把他留下重做整页，只把一把尺放在桌上，请他指出“从这里到这里”有几段。瑞安依次数过刻度线：“一、二、三、四、五。”他数的是端点，不是端点之间的距离。",
      "下午，林老师把粉笔线画在地上，让全班站在线上，再问跨过几段才到另一边。她没有说这是瑞安的错误。瑞安走了四步，回头看了看地上的五条线，把练习册翻回前一页。",
      "放学后，林老师在那幅页边小图旁画了一个小圈。第二天批改时，她先看了图，再看答案。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Teacher noticing",
    "conceptNameZh": "教师察觉",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Teacher noticing means selectively attending to classroom evidence, interpreting it through knowledge of the subject and learning, and choosing an appropriate response. It is more than general attentiveness, and not every error requires immediate whole-class correction. The important clues are those that reveal the thinking a learner is using and allow a teacher to test that interpretation."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "教师察觉是有选择地关注课堂线索，结合学科与学习知识解释其意义，再决定合适回应。它不等于一般细心，也不是发现任何错误就立即全班纠正。关键在于辨认哪些细节揭示了学习者正在使用的思路，并用回应继续检验这一判断。"
    ],
