    "explanation": "Ergonomics uses knowledge of human physical, perceptual, and cognitive differences and limitations to design tasks, tools, and workplaces. Its purpose is not merely comfort or one prescribed posture, but a better fit between people and work that reduces injury and error while supporting reliable performance. Adjustability, duration, recovery, and work organisation can all matter.",
    "explanationZh": "人体工学依据人的身体、感知、认知差异与限制来设计任务、工具和工作环境。目标不只是舒适或固定的“正确姿势”，而是改善人与工作的适配，降低伤害和错误，并支持可靠表现。可调节性、工作持续时间、恢复与组织方式都可能重要。"
