    "conceptName": "Rule of law",
    "conceptNameZh": "法治",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "The rule of law requires public power to operate through accessible, predictable, and generally applicable rules, supported by independent review, access to justice, and effective remedy against arbitrariness. Emergency power can be compatible with it when grounded in law and constrained by scope, time, records, and review rather than status alone."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "法治要求公共权力依照可获得、可预见且普遍适用的规则行使，并以独立审查、司法可及与有效救济抵抗任意权力。紧急权力并非必然违背法治，但应有明确依据、范围、期限、记录和复核，而不能只凭身份决定。"
    ],
