    "id": "0511-natural-selection",
    "batchId": "batch-007",
    "categoryCode": "05",
    "fieldCode": "0511",
    "fieldTitle": "Biology",
    "fieldTitleZh": "生物学",
    "title": "The Moths That Never Changed Colour",
    "titleZh": "没有变色的蛾",
    "summary": "Light moths become rarer after the woods darken, yet a child never sees a single moth change its colour.",
    "summaryZh": "树林变暗以后，浅色蛾越来越少，孩子却始终没看到任何一只蛾改变颜色。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "Tree trunks around Forest Town were once covered in pale lichen. Light moths were difficult to see there, while dark moths stood out. A naturalist recorded both colours each summer. As kilns spread along the town edge, soot gradually darkened the bark.",
      "A child expected light moths to darken because they needed hiding. He watched for many days and saw none change. Light remained light and dark remained dark. What changed was how easily birds found individuals that contrasted with the bark.",
      "The naturalist marked moths before returning them to the woods. In sooty areas, more dark moths survived to breed. In distant woodland where lichen remained, more light moths did. Colour could pass from parents to offspring, so the shares of the two colours differed in the next generation.",
      "Later, cleaner kiln fuel allowed lichen to return. A colour favoured earlier no longer held the advantage everywhere. The forest had not moved toward a planned goal; environmental change altered the reproductive chances of inherited differences.",
      "The child arranged years of specimens in one case. No pinned moth changed colour, yet the number of each colour shifted from row to row."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "林镇的树干原本覆着浅灰地衣，浅色蛾停在上面很难发现，深色蛾却十分显眼。自然观察员每年夏天记录两种蛾的数量。镇边窑炉增多后，烟尘使树皮逐渐变黑。",
      "一个孩子以为浅色蛾会因为需要隐藏而慢慢变深。他连续看了许多天，没有一只蛾改变颜色。浅色仍是浅色，深色仍是深色；不同的是，鸟更容易找到与树皮反差大的个体。",
      "观察员给蛾做上小标记后放回树林。黑树区中，更多深色蛾活到繁殖季；仍有地衣的远林里，浅色蛾保留得更多。蛾色能够由亲代传给后代，下一代的两种颜色所占份额因此不同。",
      "后来窑炉改用较少烟尘的燃料，地衣慢慢回来。先前有利的颜色不再在所有地方占优。树林没有朝一个预定目标前进，环境改变了不同遗传差异留下后代的机会。",
      "孩子把多年标本并排放进盒中。没有一只标本在针下变色，盒里颜色的多少却一年年改变。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Natural selection",
    "conceptNameZh": "自然选择",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Natural selection occurs when individuals differ in heritable traits and those differences produce different survival or reproductive outcomes in a particular environment, changing trait frequencies across generations. Individuals do not evolve because they need to, and selection has no predetermined goal. Mutation, drift, gene flow, and environmental change also shape evolution."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "自然选择发生在个体具有可遗传差异，而这些差异在特定环境中带来不同生存或繁殖结果，使群体中性状频率跨世代改变。个体不会因需要而主动演化，选择也没有预定目标；突变、漂变、基因流动和环境变化等也会影响结果。"
    ],
