    "id": "0511-gene-environment-interaction",
    "batchId": "batch-007",
    "categoryCode": "05",
    "fieldCode": "0511",
    "fieldTitle": "Biology",
    "fieldTitleZh": "生物学",
    "title": "Good Seed in the Wrong Valley",
    "titleZh": "种在错误山谷里的好种子",
    "summary": "The highest-yielding wheat from Gold Valley reaches Mist Valley and loses to a previously ordinary seed.",
    "summaryZh": "金谷最丰产的麦种被送到雾谷后，第一次输给了原本不起眼的另一袋种子。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "The Gold Valley growers selected red-awn wheat as their highest-yielding seed and called it the best in the region. Farmers in Mist Valley paid heavily for it, hoping to reproduce the harvest. But Mist Valley was wet and windy. Red-awn wheat lodged easily and yielded less than the ordinary local green-stem variety.",
      "Gold Valley merchants blamed poor farming, while Mist Valley suspected false seed. An agronomist divided both varieties and planted each in both valleys, keeping density and care as similar as possible.",
      "At harvest, red-awn still led in dry Gold Valley, while green-stem surpassed it in Mist Valley. Looking at one variety or one environment alone invited claims that one seed was simply better or one valley worse. Seen together, the advantage changed with growing conditions.",
      "The growers stopped naming one champion for the whole region. Dry slopes kept red-awn, wet fields used more green-stem, and new land received small trials first. Both seeds could be good and both could be placed in conditions that did not suit them.",
      "At the next distribution, the agronomist wrote both variety and trial valley on every sack and stamped none merely 'superior'."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "金谷农会选出最丰产的赤芒麦，称它为全地区最好的种子。雾谷农人花高价买来，希望复制同样收成。可雾谷潮湿多风，赤芒麦容易倒伏，产量反而低于当地普通的青秆麦。",
      "金谷商人说雾谷不会耕种，雾谷农人则怀疑种子掺假。农师把赤芒与青秆各分成两份，同时种在两座山谷，并让播种密度和照料尽量一致。",
      "收获时，赤芒仍在干燥金谷领先，青秆却在雾谷超过赤芒。若只比较一种种子或一处环境，人们会说某袋种子更好，或某个山谷更差；两边放在一起，优势会随生长条件改变。",
      "农会随后不再给全地区只发一个冠军。干坡继续种赤芒，湿地多用青秆，新田则先做小块试种。两种种子都可能很好，也都可能被放进不适合自己的环境。",
      "第二年分种时，农师在每只种袋上同时写下品种名和试种山谷，没有只盖“优等”印章。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Gene-environment interaction",
    "conceptNameZh": "基因与环境交互",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Gene-environment interaction means that the effect associated with genetic differences depends on environment, or that an environmental effect differs among genotypes. It is more specific than saying both genes and environment matter. Conclusions depend on the genotypes, environments, traits, and populations studied, and statistical interaction does not by itself reveal a molecular mechanism."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "基因与环境交互指遗传差异对性状的影响会随环境改变，或同一环境对不同基因型产生不同效果。它比“遗传和环境都重要”更具体。结论取决于研究的基因型、环境、性状和群体，观察到统计交互也不自动揭示分子机制。"
    ],
