    "explanation": "The tragedy of the commons is a dilemma in which users receive much of the gain from additional use of a rival shared resource while spreading degradation costs across the group, encouraging overuse. Depletion is not inevitable under common ownership; clear boundaries, user participation, monitoring, graduated sanctions, and dispute resolution can support durable governance.",
    "explanationZh": "公地悲剧是共享且具有竞争性的资源中，个体获得新增使用的大部分收益，却把退化成本分散给群体，导致过度使用的困境。耗竭并非共有产权的必然结果；清晰边界、使用者参与、监督、渐进制裁和争议解决可支持持久治理。"
