    "id": "0541-invariance",
    "batchId": "batch-008",
    "categoryCode": "05",
    "fieldCode": "0541",
    "fieldTitle": "Mathematics",
    "fieldTitleZh": "数学",
    "title": "The Pebbles the Box Could Not Hide",
    "titleZh": "盒子藏不住的石子",
    "summary": "An apprentice flips stones hundreds of times but cannot reach the target because every permitted move preserves one fact.",
    "summaryZh": "学徒把石子翻了几百次，仍无法得到目标图案，因为每次允许的动作都保留着同一件事。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "The mathematics hall had ten pebbles, black on one side and white on the other. Four began black side up. The rules allowed an apprentice to flip any two stones at once. The target was exactly five black stones.",
      "He tried for a whole day. Flipping two white stones added two black ones; flipping two black removed two; one of each left the count unchanged. Positions and order changed repeatedly, but the number of black faces remained even.",
      "A companion suggested putting the stones in a box and changing their order unseen. The box could hide the process but not alter the permitted move. Every step changed the black count by zero or two, so a start at four could never reach five.",
      "They had ruled out the target without listing every sequence. The master noted that parity provided an obstruction: if a target were also even, matching parity alone would not prove reachability. They would still need a construction or further conditions.",
      "Before closing the hall, the apprentice returned the picture of five black stones to the box. The lid closed over a target whose oddness remained unchanged."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "算术馆摆着十枚石子，一面黑、一面白。开始时黑面向上的石子有四枚。规则允许学徒每次同时翻转任意两枚，目标是让恰好五枚黑面向上。",
      "学徒尝试了整整一天。有时翻两白，黑石增加两枚；有时翻两黑，减少两枚；一黑一白则总数不变。他不断改变位置和顺序，黑石数量却始终是偶数。",
      "同伴建议把石子装进盒子，趁别人看不见时换顺序。盒子能够隐藏过程，却不能改变允许动作。无论走多少步，黑石数量只会变化零或两个，从四出发无法抵达五。",
      "他们因此不必枚举所有翻法，便能排除目标。馆主随后提醒，这个不变的奇偶性只提供不能到达的证据；若目标同为偶数，还需要实际构造步骤或寻找其他条件才能证明可达。",
      "收馆前，学徒把五枚石子的目标图放回盒中。盒盖合上，外面仍写着一个无法改变的奇数。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Invariance",
    "conceptNameZh": "不变量",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "An invariant is a quantity, relation, or structure preserved under specified transformations. Showing that every allowed operation preserves it can rule out targets with a different invariant value without enumerating paths. An invariant depends on the rules and usually supplies only a necessary obstruction; matching values alone need not prove reachability."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "不变量是在指定变换下保持不变的量、关系或结构。证明所有允许操作都保留它，就能排除不变量取值不同的目标，无需枚举路径。不变量依赖具体规则，通常只给出不可达的必要障碍；相同取值并不自动保证可达。"
    ],
