    "explanation": "Phenology studies the timing of recurring life events such as flowering, migration, breeding, and leaf fall and their relationship with seasonal and year-to-year environments. Different organisms may respond to chilling, accumulated warmth, day length, moisture, genetics, and other cues, so environmental change can create mismatches. Standardized long-term observations reveal trends, but prediction remains specific to organism, site, and context.",
    "explanationZh": "物候学研究开花、迁徙、繁殖、落叶等反复生命事件的时间，以及它们同季节和年际环境的关系。不同生物可能分别响应低温积累、热量、日长、水分和遗传等线索，因此环境变化会造成相互作用错配。标准化长期观察能揭示趋势，但预测必须针对物种、地点和情境。"
