    "explanation": "Bycatch is the unintended capture, injury, or mortality of non-target or unwanted organisms. Ecosystem-based fisheries management also places target fishing within relationships among habitats, food webs, multiple species, environmental change, and people. Gear selectivity, time-area measures, post-release survival, total effort, monitoring, and incentives must work together, with attention to whether an intervention merely shifts impacts elsewhere.",
    "explanationZh": "兼捕是捕捞中意外捕获、伤害或杀死非目标和不需要生物。生态系统渔业还把目标捕捞放进栖息地、食物网、多物种、环境和人的关系中管理。渔具选择性、时空避让、释放后存活、总作业强度、监测与激励要共同考虑，也要防止措施只是把影响转移到别处。"
