    "explanation": "Informed consent is a voluntary and revisable decision by a patient with decision-making capacity after receiving and understanding relevant purpose, benefits, material risks, alternatives, and the option of no intervention; it is not a signed form. Shared decision-making integrates best evidence and clinical judgement with patient values and circumstances when reasonable options exist. Communication support, checking understanding, sufficient time, and freedom from pressure are part of the process.",
    "explanationZh": "知情同意是具备决策能力的患者在获得并理解相关目的、收益、重要风险、替代方案和不处理选择后，自愿作出并可改变的决定；它不是一张签名表。共同决策在存在合理选择时，把最佳证据、临床判断与患者价值和处境结合。沟通支持、理解核查、足够时间和免受压力都是过程的一部分。"
