    "explanation": "Civilian control of the military places political objectives, military authorization, resources, oversight, and accountability under lawful constitutional civilian institutions. Military professionals provide candid expertise and implement lawful policy. It is neither partisanship, suppression of professional dissent, or arbitrary tactical micromanagement, nor does it permit a military veto over lawful policy or obedience to illegal orders. Institutions, law, transparent procedure, and clear authority sustain the relationship.",
    "explanationZh": "文官统制把政治目标、军事授权、资源、监督与问责置于合法宪制文官机构之下，军事专业人员负责坦诚提供专长并执行合法政策。它不等于党派化、压制专业异议或对战术进行随意微观管理，也不允许军队自主否决合法政策或服从非法命令。制度、法律、透明程序和清楚权责共同维持这一关系。"
