    "explanation": "Situational crime prevention analyses immediate opportunities for a specific offence and changes environment or management to increase effort and detection risk or reduce reward, provocation, or excuses. Measures should match place, time, and mechanism and assess displacement, diffusion of benefit, fairness, privacy, and exclusion. It complements rather than replaces lawful investigation, social prevention, and attention to broader causes.",
    "explanationZh": "情境犯罪预防通过分析特定违法行为发生的即时机会，改变环境或管理以增加难度和被发现风险、减少收益、诱发因素或借口。措施需精确对应地点、时间和机制，并评估犯罪转移、扩散获益、公平、隐私与排斥。它补充而非替代合法调查、社会预防和对更广原因的处理。"
